      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "primal",
        "unholy"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The river drake spits a ball of caustic mucus up to a range of 30 feet that explodes in a 5ft Burst. Creatures within the burst take 3d6 Spirit Damage damage (Basic DC 17 Reflex Saving Throw save). Those that fail this save also take a –5-foot status penalty to their Speed for 1 round.</p>\n<p>The river drake can't use Chthonic Mucus again for 1d6 rounds.</p><hr /><p>Effect: Chthonic Mucus (1-2)</p>",
